    {
        "text": "Provence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Provence, you're absolutely, positively sure I can't burn this place down to the ground?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "text": "All these useless branches and weeds are really getting on my nerves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the tenth time I've heard you complaining this hour, princess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, I originally planned on just checking out some stuff alone while collecting some samples for Eyjafjalla along the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "You offered to join me in this investigation yourself, so nobody's forcing you to stay if you can't handle it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now, the others are having fun at the beach. You should join them instead of going through this mess here with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't leave you alone, not with your tendencies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though you're a Catastrophe Messenger, only my knowledge can keep you safe in this kind of fire hazard area.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "All the more reason we can't set this entire mountain on fire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though I know this is your specialty... we're on vacation this time. It'd be best to keep a low profile.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "Otherwise, Amiya and the Doctor will end up having to clean up the mess again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, for their sake, I'll try to put up with this a bit longer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, do you see that black-colored outcropping over there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like it might be obsidian. Let's go check it out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Careful now, don't just go running around. And especially, don't set stuff on fire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew... Keeping her in check is more tiring than the investigation itself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "But something's off... Even if it's summer, this kind of heat... doesn't seem natural.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
