        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Big tail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 3,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Big tail!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? Wait, you mean me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you notice a weird smell earlier?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that you mention it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm. Very faint, but it's definitely there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The volcano is expelling more gas than I expected, and the test rune Eyjafjalla gave me is reacting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the looks of things, this place is going to go up in flames even without my help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Something doesn't seem right about this volcano...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the most we can do is turn to Eyjafjalla for confirmation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Over here, we can get some samples from this outcropping.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 3,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "There, that should be enough!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
