    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We can do some preliminary tests on this sample with our equipment before sending it back to Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eyjafjalla should be able to turn the test results around right away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Just based upon how this obsidian feels to the touch... I can't say for sure, but there's something different about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also taking the smell and the temperature around here into consideration...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't say for certain, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you trying to say? Spit it out already!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Come at me! What are a few slugs going to do?! I'll take you all out right here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 3,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Curses, the hem of my skirt got stuck...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "C-can anyone hear me?! Why are there so many Originium slugs here?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "N-no! Stay away from me! Someone help me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$indust_intro",
        "key": "$indust_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1",
        "name2": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone's calling for help! It's coming from the beach!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's hurry over there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_166_skfire_3#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, wait for me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
